title: Soldier's Joy
key: D
type: instrumental
form: AABB
feel: 2/4, medium-fast
rights: public-domain
notes: Usually the first tune at a jam. Everyone knows it.
verified: false
break: Learn the A part melody first — most jammers recognise it instantly. Drone the open strings.
break.mandolin: Use the open D and A strings as drones under the melody.

[A]
| 1 | 1 | 1 | 5 |
| 1 | 1 | 5 | 1 |

[B]
| 1 | 4 | 1 | 5 |
| 1 | 4 | 5 | 1 |
